+
+This project currently has conflicting recorded decisions on the password hashing algorithm. The user decision (2026-09-11) specified bcrypt, while a review accepted on the same date specified argon2id. Both decisions have equal trust level (3 — stated by user). The conflict must be resolved before implementation.
